flowchart TB
  P[Shopify / Stripe] --> I[Raw provider ingress]
  I --> C[Endpoint config + tenant resolution]
  C --> V{HMAC / signature valid?}
  V -->|No| X[Record metadata only + reject]
  V -->|Yes| D{Delivery ID seen?}
  D -->|Yes| K[Return success - idempotent]
  D -->|No| E[Append immutable event envelope]
  E --> Q[(Durable queue)]
  E --> A[Return 2xx quickly]
  Q --> W[Async worker]
  W --> N[Normalize + policy-backed repair proposal]
  N --> O[Downstream delivery adapter]
  O --> R{Succeeded?}
  R -->|Yes| H[Append delivery attempt + trace]
  R -->|No| B[Retry policy + backoff]
  B --> DLQ[Dead-letter state + alert]
  E --> F[Redacted forensic artifact store]
  H --> M[(Read model / metrics)]
  DLQ --> M
  F --> M
  M --> U[Protected Control Plane]
  U --> L[Safe local replay / approved replay]

  classDef secure fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d;
  classDef async fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#1e3a8a;
  classDef risk fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d;
  class V,D,C secure;
  class Q,W,B async;
  class X,DLQ risk;
